Preview selected message assignments, or apply them with a preview token

Usage: mxr categories assign [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --message-ids <MESSAGE_IDS>
      --add <ADD>
      --remove <REMOVE>
      --preview-token <PREVIEW_TOKEN>
  -h, --help                           Print help
